WEBVTT

00:01.427 --> 00:02.967
[WOMAN 1]
<i>Do you know the legend?</i>

00:03.047 --> 00:04.927
[MAN 1] <i>I heard something wild</i>
<i>about payphones.</i>

00:05.007 --> 00:07.727
[MAN 2] <i>If you answer the call,</i>
<i>you'll be taken to paradise.</i>

00:07.807 --> 00:08.887
[WOMAN 2] <i>For real?</i>

00:09.517 --> 00:11.517
<i>Payphones are such a vibe.</i>

00:12.147 --> 00:13.477
[MAN 3]
<i>Do they still have those?</i>

00:14.517 --> 00:15.687
[WOMAN 3] <i>I learned</i>
<i>how to use them</i>

00:15.777 --> 00:16.897
<i>in grade school.</i>

00:16.987 --> 00:20.027
[MAN 4] <i>I saw it on TV.</i>
<i>People have already disappeared.</i>

00:22.737 --> 00:27.947
[payphone ringing]

00:28.037 --> 00:29.997
[♪ opening theme song playing]

01:58.537 --> 02:00.297
[grunts, groans]

02:00.377 --> 02:01.507
EPISODE 1: URBAN LEGEND

02:01.587 --> 02:02.967
Hando! You okay?

02:03.297 --> 02:04.797
Speak to me, man!

02:05.177 --> 02:06.967
That wasn't cool,
you little jerk!

02:07.047 --> 02:08.137
Who you calling "little"?

02:09.047 --> 02:12.427
Call me Ageha Yoshina
of Shira High, class 1-C.

02:12.517 --> 02:15.347
And if punishing gorillas who
extort our students isn't cool,

02:15.437 --> 02:18.017
then I am A-okay
being the lord of losers.

02:18.107 --> 02:19.227
And my work here is done.

02:19.727 --> 02:21.817
How's the bad guy safari?

02:21.897 --> 02:23.857
It's quick and dirty as usual.

02:23.947 --> 02:25.027
There's no trouble out there

02:25.107 --> 02:27.697
that Ageha won't fix
for 10,000 yen.

02:27.777 --> 02:28.777
I know.

02:28.867 --> 02:30.447
That guy is always
looking for something

02:30.537 --> 02:31.697
to get mixed up in.

02:31.787 --> 02:33.787
It's kinda like his passion.

02:33.867 --> 02:34.907
[chuckles]

02:34.997 --> 02:36.747
Nah, that's not it.

02:36.827 --> 02:38.877
<i>It's just an excuse</i>
<i>for him to fight people.</i>

02:39.957 --> 02:40.917
[Ageha sighs]

02:40.997 --> 02:42.087
<i>I'm bored.</i>

02:42.167 --> 02:43.467
[cars honking]

02:43.547 --> 02:45.007
<i>What's even the point?</i>

02:45.087 --> 02:47.257
<i>Internet says</i>
<i>the planet's basically dead,</i>

02:47.587 --> 02:48.637
<i>or will be soon.</i>

02:49.967 --> 02:51.177
<i>We're already on fast track</i>

02:51.257 --> 02:54.097
<i>to turning the Earth</i>
<i>into a giant humanity oven.</i>

02:54.227 --> 02:56.437
<i>It's all that toxic crap</i>
<i>we keep releasing.</i>

02:56.517 --> 02:58.977
<i>We can't get rid of war,</i>
<i>so we can't get rid of nukes.</i>

02:59.057 --> 03:00.317
<i>So if the first thing happens,</i>

03:00.397 --> 03:02.477
<i>the second's gonna</i>
<i>wipe us off the map.</i>

03:02.567 --> 03:04.897
<i>And apparently we've only</i>
<i>got 30 years of oil left,</i>

03:04.987 --> 03:07.067
<i>so a crisis is</i>
<i>more "when" than "if."</i>

03:07.157 --> 03:10.407
Yo! I'm all done for the day.
Let's go.

03:10.487 --> 03:13.747
<i>Plus, online abuse is racking up</i>
<i>a real-life body count.</i>

03:13.827 --> 03:15.157
<i>And there's the fact</i>
<i>that we have to work</i>

03:15.247 --> 03:17.247
<i>until we die because, economy.</i>

03:17.327 --> 03:18.287
<i>Then again...</i>

03:18.377 --> 03:21.207
Who gives a shit? Not me.

03:21.287 --> 03:22.207
Cool.

03:22.287 --> 03:23.877
About what, exactly?

03:23.957 --> 03:25.297
[AGEHA] It doesn't matter.

03:25.377 --> 03:28.127
I was just thinking so loud,
some of it leaked out.

03:28.217 --> 03:30.047
I'm sure if you thought
about school at all,

03:30.137 --> 03:31.797
that wouldn't happen
as much, Ageha.

03:31.887 --> 03:33.637
Aw, who's a big grown-up buddy?

03:33.717 --> 03:34.767
Yes, you are.

03:35.727 --> 03:36.807
[AGEHA] <i>Whatever.</i>

03:36.887 --> 03:39.057
<i>Who even cares</i>
<i>about the future anymore?</i>

03:39.137 --> 03:41.477
<i>The present's enough</i>
<i>for me, thanks.</i>

03:42.267 --> 03:43.227
Crap!

03:43.977 --> 03:47.147
Sis is gonna smack me around
so bad if I'm late again!

03:47.237 --> 03:48.857
[payphone ringing]

03:49.487 --> 03:51.367
-Huh?
-[payphone continues ringing]

03:52.567 --> 03:54.617
Is that payphone
ringing right now?

03:55.247 --> 03:56.657
Freaky!

03:56.747 --> 03:58.327
Thought they went extinct.

03:58.417 --> 04:00.787
-[door opens]
-Do I pick up, or...

04:01.537 --> 04:03.457
Okay, I'm picking up.

04:05.167 --> 04:07.297
Hello? Payphone here.

04:07.377 --> 04:09.087
[line screeching]

04:09.167 --> 04:10.677
-[eerie voice yells]
-Hmm?

04:11.257 --> 04:12.257
[gasps]

04:12.677 --> 04:14.047
-[eerie voice yells]
-[gasps]

04:14.137 --> 04:15.057
[phone receiver clatters]

04:15.137 --> 04:16.427
What the...

04:16.517 --> 04:17.927
[eerie voice yells]

04:18.767 --> 04:20.767
Great. Now it's gone.

04:22.227 --> 04:23.357
So weird.

04:23.767 --> 04:25.227
-[payphone beeps]
-Uh?

04:28.527 --> 04:29.697
Oh, hey.

04:29.777 --> 04:31.407
It's one of those
old phone cards.

04:32.027 --> 04:33.067
Huh?

04:33.157 --> 04:34.487
What's Puh-sy-ren?

04:34.987 --> 04:36.697
-[birds chirping]
-[indistinct chatter]

04:37.657 --> 04:38.947
[BOY] Whoa, Ageha.

04:39.037 --> 04:40.077
You look beat.

04:40.157 --> 04:41.457
What happened last night?

04:41.537 --> 04:44.207
My sister gave me
a three-hour lecture

04:44.287 --> 04:45.667
for getting home so late.

04:45.747 --> 04:48.007
The Health Risks
of Being Out Past Curfew.

04:48.087 --> 04:50.087
Yeah, your sis is pretty scary.

04:50.177 --> 04:51.677
But in a hot way.

04:51.757 --> 04:53.387
You sure
that's what pissed her off?

04:53.467 --> 04:54.757
Did you mention the fight?

04:54.847 --> 04:56.967
You shut your mouth!
I'm not suicidal!

04:58.927 --> 05:01.137
And I'm bored again.

05:01.517 --> 05:03.727
Why hasn't that gorilla
or one of his goons

05:03.807 --> 05:05.317
come looking for revenge yet?

05:05.397 --> 05:07.937
I even told those guys where
I went to school and everything.

05:08.027 --> 05:10.357
You know something worse
is gonna happen now.

05:11.237 --> 05:12.907
Hmm? Ice Queen's back.

05:13.657 --> 05:15.237
So she actually came
to school today.

05:15.317 --> 05:17.157
[♪ mysterious music playing]

05:18.697 --> 05:22.287
[AGEHA] <i>Sakurako Amamiya,</i>
<i>AKA Ice Queen.</i>

05:22.367 --> 05:23.877
<i>A rare sight these days.</i>

05:23.957 --> 05:26.917
<i>As far as anyone knows,</i>
<i>she doesn't have friends.</i>

05:26.997 --> 05:28.877
<i>Some people in class</i>
<i>tried to fix that</i>

05:28.957 --> 05:30.297
<i>back at the start of the year.</i>

05:30.667 --> 05:31.587
<i>Didn't go well.</i>

05:31.927 --> 05:33.717
<i>We'd all just</i>
<i>entered high school,</i>

05:33.797 --> 05:35.637
<i>and people were geared up</i>
<i>to make friends.</i>

05:36.217 --> 05:37.637
<i>Pair of girls</i>
<i>approached Amamiya,</i>

05:37.717 --> 05:39.307
<i>and what she said back to them,</i>

05:39.717 --> 05:41.227
<i>well, it earned her title.</i>

05:41.807 --> 05:43.687
Psyren does not wait.

05:43.767 --> 05:44.807
It does not slow.

05:44.897 --> 05:47.607
Fighting it is like
fighting the sun rising.

05:47.687 --> 05:48.977
We will die.

05:49.067 --> 05:50.777
Not that you'll ever
see it coming.

05:51.357 --> 05:53.397
But then,
maybe that's a good thing.

05:53.487 --> 05:56.617
You can enjoy your meaningless
young lives until then.

05:56.697 --> 05:57.867
-[GIRL 1] Uh...
-[GIRL 2] Okay.

05:57.947 --> 05:59.737
[AGEHA]
<i>And that's how Sakurako Amamiya</i>

05:59.827 --> 06:01.247
<i>became the untouchable,</i>

06:01.327 --> 06:03.827
<i>super-cool rebel</i>
<i>nihilist Ice Queen.</i>

06:04.327 --> 06:05.577
<i>It's also why most of the class</i>

06:05.667 --> 06:07.537
<i>hasn't said so much</i>
<i>as two words to her.</i>

06:09.167 --> 06:10.877
<i>Well, except for me.</i>

06:12.417 --> 06:13.507
<i>This isn't the first time</i>

06:13.587 --> 06:15.087
<i>that she and I</i>
<i>have been classmates.</i>

06:15.427 --> 06:18.807
<i>Back then, she was fun,</i>
<i>popular, happy even.</i>

06:18.887 --> 06:19.927
<i>And kind.</i>

06:20.597 --> 06:22.177
<i>I remember when my mom died,</i>

06:22.267 --> 06:24.347
<i>she'd cheer me up</i>
<i>whenever I'd have a breakdown.</i>

06:26.647 --> 06:27.937
[GIRL 1]
Who does she think she is?

06:28.017 --> 06:30.017
-Am I right? [laughs]
-[GIRL 2] Yeah, I know!

06:30.107 --> 06:31.397
-[girls laughs]
-Hmm?

06:37.407 --> 06:38.367
Hmm.

06:41.697 --> 06:42.747
Uh.

06:42.827 --> 06:44.577
I bet she'll be looking
for this.

06:44.657 --> 06:46.167
SHIRATAKI HIGH SCHOOL STUDENT ID
GENERAL EDUCATION, CLASS 1-C

06:47.457 --> 06:49.167
She got one of these things too?

06:53.297 --> 06:55.587
[whimpering]

06:55.677 --> 06:58.087
Hey, Amamiya.
I found your wallet.

06:58.177 --> 06:59.137
[Amamiya gasps]

07:00.007 --> 07:03.177
Okay? You know,
a thank-you would be nice.

07:03.717 --> 07:04.977
Someone threw...

07:05.057 --> 07:06.557
I mean, yeah.

07:06.637 --> 07:07.807
I'm aware.

07:08.227 --> 07:09.607
It happens all the time.

07:09.687 --> 07:11.067
But thank you.

07:11.147 --> 07:12.147
Uh?

07:12.897 --> 07:14.567
Hey, wait up.

07:14.647 --> 07:16.277
You know that word
on your phone card?

07:16.857 --> 07:18.027
How do you say it?

07:18.107 --> 07:19.277
[AMAMIYA] Phone card?

07:19.367 --> 07:21.407
No. You're mistaken.

07:21.487 --> 07:23.197
I don't have a red phone card.

07:23.787 --> 07:25.907
You saw nothing, Ageha Yoshina.

07:25.997 --> 07:26.957
Got it?

07:27.037 --> 07:29.877
And don't ever ask me
about it again, you understand?

07:30.207 --> 07:32.047
There are things
that you're better off not--

07:32.127 --> 07:34.627
[gasps] No! Please not now.

07:34.707 --> 07:35.707
[panting]

07:35.797 --> 07:37.587
Off what? Better off what?

07:38.087 --> 07:39.507
Please don't follow me.

07:40.007 --> 07:42.927
Listen, if you're in some
kinda trouble, I can help.

07:43.007 --> 07:45.177
Counseling fee's
only 10K per hour.

07:47.387 --> 07:49.767
[AMAMIYA] Please, save me.

07:49.847 --> 07:50.767
[gasps softly]

07:51.437 --> 07:52.897
Wait, stop!

07:54.357 --> 07:55.607
[gasps]

08:01.197 --> 08:02.157
<i>The next day,</i>

08:02.237 --> 08:04.947
<i>the authorities declared</i>
<i>Sakurako Amamiya missing.</i>

08:06.497 --> 08:09.747
<i>Rumors about her disappearance</i>
<i>spread like wildfire.</i>

08:09.827 --> 08:13.087
<i>Stuff like, she ran</i>
<i>from an abusive home.</i>

08:13.167 --> 08:14.837
<i>Yakuza debt collectors.</i>

08:14.917 --> 08:16.167
<i>Falling in with a cult.</i>

08:16.257 --> 08:17.717
<i>The list was long,</i>

08:17.797 --> 08:19.967
<i>each one more ridiculous</i>
<i>than the last.</i>

08:20.887 --> 08:24.007
<i>I don't believe them,</i>
<i>but I do wonder where she is.</i>

08:24.677 --> 08:26.807
"Pysren is coming for us," huh?

08:26.887 --> 08:27.977
[gasps]

08:30.307 --> 08:32.147
-[exclaims]
-Wait, what did you just say?

08:32.227 --> 08:33.937
Spell that word
for me right now!

08:34.017 --> 08:35.267
[grunts]

08:35.357 --> 08:37.237
It was something Amamiya said.

08:37.317 --> 08:39.277
Remember?
At the start of the year?

08:39.777 --> 08:41.197
Dude, you were there too.

08:41.777 --> 08:43.067
[AGEHA] <i>Psyren.</i>

08:43.157 --> 08:44.907
<i>So that's what</i>
<i>she was talking about!</i>

08:45.487 --> 08:47.497
Isn't it from an urban legend?

08:48.077 --> 08:50.747
It's a shady, secret society,
something or other.

08:50.827 --> 08:51.827
[AGEHA] A secret society?

08:52.417 --> 08:54.707
Stories about it
have been going viral lately.

08:54.997 --> 08:57.667
Apparently, they find
people tired of reality,

08:57.757 --> 09:00.257
and then guide them
to a new paradise.

09:00.337 --> 09:02.007
Surprised
you haven't heard of it.

09:02.087 --> 09:03.637
I mean, you have heard
about all the people

09:03.717 --> 09:05.347
going missing
around the country, right?

09:05.427 --> 09:06.807
No, I haven't.

09:07.097 --> 09:09.267
You should go ask
the occult club about it.

09:09.347 --> 09:11.187
This is exactly
their kind of thing.

09:11.267 --> 09:12.637
OCCULT CLUB

09:12.727 --> 09:16.607
[♪ mysterious music playing]

09:16.687 --> 09:19.067
I would advise you
foregoing delving deeper

09:19.147 --> 09:21.107
into Pysren's mysteries.

09:21.197 --> 09:24.157
Your ignorance of things
occultic will be your doom!

09:24.737 --> 09:25.947
Yeah, don't care.

09:26.327 --> 09:29.947
Well, I suppose I do owe you
for besting that beast.

09:30.037 --> 09:31.577
Tell me,
have you been keeping tabs

09:31.657 --> 09:34.537
on the recent influx
in missing person cases?

09:34.627 --> 09:35.627
I know that it's weird.

09:35.707 --> 09:38.667
All ordinary people
with ordinary lives,

09:38.757 --> 09:40.507
vanishing without a trace.

09:40.587 --> 09:43.047
No connections
or commonalities between cases,

09:43.127 --> 09:45.137
save for the fact
that people are gone,

09:45.217 --> 09:46.717
and the police are baffled.

09:46.797 --> 09:48.217
But there's a rumor online

09:48.307 --> 09:50.427
that may be
more truth than fiction.

09:50.517 --> 09:52.097
These disappearances
are the workings

09:52.177 --> 09:54.347
of a secret cabal
of unknown power.

09:54.437 --> 09:56.727
Psyren and its agent, Nemesis Q!

09:57.517 --> 09:59.397
[AGEHA] Nema-what-now?

09:59.477 --> 10:01.397
Any facts about Nemesis Q

10:01.487 --> 10:03.947
are as elusive
and ethereal as they are.

10:04.027 --> 10:06.617
All we know is they appear,
then vanish like smoke.

10:08.777 --> 10:09.947
[gasps]

10:10.037 --> 10:13.327
[BOY] <i>But not before giving</i>
<i>the sad souls seeking paradise</i>

10:13.407 --> 10:15.577
<i>a red phone card</i>
<i>that will lead them</i>

10:15.667 --> 10:17.457
<i>down the path to Psyren.</i>

10:17.537 --> 10:18.627
<i>And wouldn't you know it,</i>

10:18.707 --> 10:21.127
<i>all the missing people were</i>
<i>rumored to have acquired</i>

10:21.207 --> 10:23.417
<i>a red phone card</i>
<i>before disappearing.</i>

10:23.507 --> 10:26.047
<i>The prevailing theory</i>
<i>is that they were spirited away</i>

10:26.137 --> 10:27.797
<i>the moment they used them.</i>

10:29.347 --> 10:30.347
[scoffs]

10:30.427 --> 10:31.807
What a load of bull.

10:32.387 --> 10:34.597
Who even uses
phone cards anymore?

10:34.887 --> 10:37.307
Sounds like basic
urban legend stuff to me.

10:37.397 --> 10:38.687
[chuckles]

10:38.767 --> 10:42.107
Maybe at first, but I haven't
gotten to the juicy part yet.

10:42.187 --> 10:45.817
You see, this legend comes
with an enormous cash prize!

10:45.897 --> 10:47.737
500 million yen
to whomever discovers

10:47.817 --> 10:48.907
the truth about Psyren!

10:48.987 --> 10:50.657
What?! From who?!

10:50.737 --> 10:52.537
[BOY] <i>A billionaire</i>
<i>and prominent figure</i>

10:52.617 --> 10:53.957
<i>in the occult world.</i>

10:54.037 --> 10:55.707
<i>Needless to say,</i>
<i>they've inspired</i>

10:55.787 --> 10:58.377
<i>many an amateur</i>
<i>paranormal investigator.</i>

10:58.457 --> 11:01.087
<i>Occult fans,</i>
<i>media outlets, the Yakuza.</i>

11:01.167 --> 11:02.207
<i>It's the hot new craze,</i>

11:02.297 --> 11:04.417
<i>and everyone is</i>
<i>getting caught up in it.</i>

11:04.507 --> 11:06.797
There's even a boutique industry
that's cropped up

11:06.887 --> 11:10.177
around auctioning off
genuine Psyren cards on the web.

11:10.257 --> 11:12.807
Of course, most of what
one might find are fakes.

11:12.887 --> 11:15.427
But a real, verified,
unused Psyren card

11:15.517 --> 11:18.187
could go for at least
five million, easily.

11:18.267 --> 11:20.607
Whoa. That's a lot of cash.

11:21.857 --> 11:23.277
Tempting, no?

11:23.357 --> 11:26.197
Still, it's best
to leave Psyren a mystery.

11:26.277 --> 11:28.867
Someone who'd been running
a Psyren investigation site

11:28.947 --> 11:31.197
ended up dead,
and they won't be the last.

11:38.787 --> 11:39.997
Amamiya.

11:42.087 --> 11:44.547
[WOMAN] And here's the windup.

11:44.627 --> 11:45.627
[AGEHA] Wait, wait, wait! No!

11:45.717 --> 11:47.127
[grunts]

11:47.667 --> 11:49.797
[groans] That hurt!

11:49.887 --> 11:52.217
It's what happens
when some lady tells me

11:52.297 --> 11:53.717
you've been fighting again!

11:54.007 --> 11:56.887
Really. Did I
or did I not say I'd kill you

11:56.977 --> 11:58.347
if you kept stirring up trouble?

11:58.437 --> 11:59.977
That's not it!

12:00.057 --> 12:02.647
-I was helping someone!
-Don't talk back!

12:02.727 --> 12:04.607
You're not a kid.
You're in high school.

12:04.687 --> 12:07.607
And I expect you
to start acting like it.

12:07.697 --> 12:09.947
What do you wanna do
with your life, huh?

12:10.027 --> 12:11.737
You wanna be a street bum?

12:11.827 --> 12:13.327
Because that's what
you're headed for.

12:13.907 --> 12:16.037
I swear, Mom would be
in tears over this.

12:16.117 --> 12:17.497
[sighs]

12:19.157 --> 12:20.667
Dad called me earlier,
by the way,

12:20.747 --> 12:22.787
and he's just as worried
about you as I am.

12:23.287 --> 12:24.667
But he's away on business,

12:24.747 --> 12:27.417
which means I'm the adult,
and my word is law.

12:27.507 --> 12:28.627
I hereby ground you

12:28.717 --> 12:31.217
for the crime of fighting thugs
while knowing better.

12:31.587 --> 12:33.927
Think about sneaking out,
and you're dead.

12:37.807 --> 12:40.597
Come on.
Every time she hits me harder.

12:40.687 --> 12:43.267
[AGEHA'S SISTER] <i>What do you</i>
<i>wanna do with your life, huh?</i>

12:43.857 --> 12:45.647
Don't know, don't care.

12:46.147 --> 12:47.857
It's not like
I gotta worry about it.

12:47.937 --> 12:50.067
Soon as I sell this, I'm golden.

12:52.617 --> 12:54.987
All right, now, where's
the best place to do that?

12:55.487 --> 12:58.617
ANOTHER VICTIM GOES MISSING
IN STRING OF DISAPPEARANCES

12:58.707 --> 13:01.247
[BOY] <i>They appear,</i>
<i>then vanish like smoke.</i>

13:01.327 --> 13:03.587
<i>But not before giving</i>
<i>the souls seeking paradise</i>

13:03.667 --> 13:05.707
<i>a red phone card</i>
<i>to lead them to Psyren.</i>

13:06.957 --> 13:09.507
[AMAMIYA] Please, save me.

13:22.387 --> 13:24.107
[AGEHA]
<i>If I do get out of this mess,</i>

13:24.187 --> 13:26.517
<i>I am definitely</i>
<i>charging you hazard pay.</i>

13:26.607 --> 13:27.727
<i>You got that?</i>

13:30.647 --> 13:32.447
<i>Nope, can't do it!</i>

13:32.527 --> 13:34.197
<i>I can't throw away five million!</i>

13:35.447 --> 13:37.237
[gasps]

13:37.327 --> 13:39.407
[wails] I did it!

13:39.497 --> 13:40.997
Amamiya!

13:41.077 --> 13:42.407
[auto dialing]

13:42.497 --> 13:43.747
[gasps]

13:43.827 --> 13:44.997
[clears throat]

13:45.087 --> 13:46.877
[line ringing]

13:46.957 --> 13:48.047
[OPERATOR] <i>Hello, and thank you</i>

13:48.127 --> 13:50.837
<i>for calling the Psyren</i>
<i>Immigration Control Center.</i>

13:50.917 --> 13:53.507
<i>-Worlds will be connected.</i>
-Uh...

13:53.587 --> 13:54.837
[OPERATOR]
<i>Your immigration interview</i>

13:54.927 --> 13:56.427
<i>will begin momentarily.</i>

13:56.797 --> 13:58.347
<i>Please remain on the line.</i>

13:58.427 --> 14:01.017
<i>Answer yes or no</i>
<i>to the following.</i>

14:01.387 --> 14:03.727
<i>For yes,</i>
<i>press one on the pin pad.</i>

14:03.807 --> 14:05.397
<i>For no, press two.</i>

14:05.727 --> 14:07.357
<i>Do not speak your answer.</i>

14:07.437 --> 14:08.607
<i>Question one.</i>

14:08.687 --> 14:11.397
<i>Are you a Japanese citizen</i>
<i>aged 12 or older?</i>

14:11.487 --> 14:12.697
<i>Yes or no</i>.

14:12.777 --> 14:15.567
Don't speak it? Okay.

14:15.657 --> 14:16.777
One.

14:16.867 --> 14:17.907
[OPERATOR] <i>Question two.</i>

14:17.987 --> 14:20.537
<i>Do you have any hope</i>
<i>for this country's future?</i>

14:20.617 --> 14:21.957
<i>Yes or no</i>.

14:22.457 --> 14:23.657
<i>Question three.</i>

14:23.747 --> 14:25.377
<i>Have you suffered</i>
<i>a brain injury,</i>

14:25.457 --> 14:26.537
<i>been diagnosed with,</i>

14:26.627 --> 14:29.037
<i>or have a family history</i>
<i>of mental illness?</i>

14:29.127 --> 14:30.667
<i>Yes or no</i>.

14:31.667 --> 14:32.837
<i>Question four.</i>

14:32.917 --> 14:35.297
<i>Do you experience</i>
<i>chronic respiratory distress</i>

14:35.387 --> 14:37.007
<i>or find that you</i>
<i>often have difficulty</i>

14:37.097 --> 14:38.797
<i>breathing this planet's air?</i>

14:38.887 --> 14:40.177
<i>Yes or no</i>.

14:41.427 --> 14:42.557
<i>Question 12.</i>

14:42.637 --> 14:44.887
<i>Are you able</i>
<i>to communicate without words?</i>

14:44.977 --> 14:46.347
<i>Yes or no</i>.

14:47.437 --> 14:48.807
<i>Question 18.</i>

14:48.897 --> 14:50.687
<i>Have you ever shed blue blood?</i>

14:50.767 --> 14:52.187
<i>Yes or no</i>.

14:53.397 --> 14:54.487
<i>Question 30.</i>

14:54.567 --> 14:56.317
<i>Have you ever</i>
<i>killed a living creature</i>

14:56.407 --> 14:57.777
<i>larger than a human?</i>

14:57.867 --> 14:59.277
<i>Yes or no</i>.

15:00.027 --> 15:01.237
<i>Question 60.</i>

15:01.327 --> 15:03.957
<i>Do you feel unfulfilled</i>
<i>with your high school life?</i>

15:04.037 --> 15:05.537
<i>Yes or no</i>.

15:06.247 --> 15:07.917
<i>Question 61.</i>

15:07.997 --> 15:09.087
<i>Do you avoid thinking</i>

15:09.167 --> 15:11.337
<i>about the planet's future</i>
<i>or your own?</i>

15:11.417 --> 15:12.667
<i>Yes or no.</i>

15:12.757 --> 15:14.507
[AGEHA]
How long is this gonna go?

15:14.917 --> 15:16.337
[OPERATOR] <i>Question 62.</i>

15:16.427 --> 15:18.047
<i>Do you intend</i>
<i>to break the curfew</i>

15:18.137 --> 15:19.797
<i>your family has set for you?</i>

15:20.257 --> 15:21.307
[gasps]

15:21.387 --> 15:23.347
[OPERATOR] <i>Does your sister</i>
<i>acting as a stand-in</i>

15:23.427 --> 15:25.427
<i>for your deceased mother</i>
<i>annoy you?</i>

15:25.807 --> 15:27.437
<i>Do you find</i>
<i>that your mind is crowded</i>

15:27.517 --> 15:29.057
<i>with thoughts</i>
<i>you'd rather not have,</i>

15:29.147 --> 15:31.397
<i>and only by surrendering</i>
<i>to intense violence</i>

15:31.477 --> 15:33.187
<i>do you feel</i>
<i>any semblance of relief?</i>

15:34.987 --> 15:36.777
This isn't funny, ya hear me?

15:36.857 --> 15:40.077
I'm done with this,
so just come on out already!

15:40.657 --> 15:42.617
<i>How'd they know about my family?</i>

15:42.697 --> 15:44.697
<i>Have these freaks</i>
<i>been stalking me?</i>

15:49.747 --> 15:52.207
[OPERATOR]
<i>Do not step away from the phone.</i>

15:52.287 --> 15:53.877
<i>This is not a game.</i>

15:53.957 --> 15:55.127
<i>You called us,</i>

15:55.217 --> 15:57.587
<i>and we are trying</i>
<i>to give you what you want.</i>

15:57.667 --> 15:59.087
And how's that?

15:59.677 --> 16:00.597
[OPERATOR] <i>At present,</i>

16:00.677 --> 16:03.097
<i>you believe</i>
<i>that the world is your oyster.</i>

16:03.177 --> 16:07.057
<i>That nothing is closed to you,</i>
<i>and you are capable of anything.</i>

16:07.137 --> 16:08.477
<i>But, in actuality,</i>

16:08.557 --> 16:10.557
<i>you're just</i>
<i>a stupid little virgin.</i>

16:10.647 --> 16:12.857
I am not little, computer-bitch!

16:12.937 --> 16:15.147
I'm the hero saving Amamiya!

16:15.237 --> 16:17.987
Ageha Yoshina
from Shira High School!

16:18.067 --> 16:19.447
Now give her back to me!

16:19.527 --> 16:21.527
Or it's my foot, your ass!

16:22.157 --> 16:23.697
[OPERATOR] <i>Final question.</i>

16:23.777 --> 16:25.577
<i>Do you want to go to Psyren?</i>

16:25.867 --> 16:27.327
<i>Yes or no.</i>

16:27.907 --> 16:29.207
[AGEHA] Yeah. I'm done with you.

16:30.457 --> 16:31.577
[slams]

16:32.667 --> 16:34.167
You'll see.

16:34.247 --> 16:37.717
I can find you "secret society"
freaks my own way.

16:38.297 --> 16:39.627
Just wait.

16:40.637 --> 16:42.677
[panting]

16:42.757 --> 16:44.807
-[man sniffing]
-Mm?

16:45.387 --> 16:46.637
What is going on here?

16:46.727 --> 16:48.637
[gasps, shudders]

16:48.727 --> 16:51.767
Good news is,
someone used this booth,

16:51.857 --> 16:53.397
looks like at 1:00
in the morning.

16:53.477 --> 16:55.017
It just had to
have been our guy.

16:55.107 --> 16:56.607
[MAN] Yes.

16:56.687 --> 16:58.567
I see a child.

16:58.647 --> 17:01.607
A confused
and angry high school boy.

17:01.697 --> 17:03.367
All heart, no brains.

17:04.117 --> 17:05.697
Why, hello.

17:05.787 --> 17:07.947
[AGEHA] <i>I am not little,</i>
<i>computer-bitch!</i>

17:08.037 --> 17:10.457
<i>Ageha Yoshina</i>
<i>from Shira High School!</i>

17:10.957 --> 17:12.877
[chuckles]

17:12.957 --> 17:14.087
So polite.

17:14.167 --> 17:15.337
Let's go, Miyake.

17:15.917 --> 17:17.047
Naughty boy.

17:17.127 --> 17:19.007
Now we have to teach you
what happens

17:19.087 --> 17:21.047
when amateurs call up Psyren.

17:21.127 --> 17:22.887
SHIRATAKI HIGH SCHOOL

17:24.217 --> 17:26.217
Any help would be appreciated.

17:26.307 --> 17:28.467
Right.
And what's this all about?

17:28.557 --> 17:29.597
A student.

17:29.677 --> 17:32.517
We believe he can help us
with an ongoing investigation.

17:33.727 --> 17:35.357
Do you have a photo roster?

17:38.567 --> 17:39.987
[AGEHA] <i>What now?</i>

17:40.067 --> 17:43.067
<i>The card can't be the only way</i>
<i>to find Psyren, can it?</i>

17:43.157 --> 17:45.827
[TEACHER]
<i>Ageha Yoshina of class 1-C.</i>

17:45.907 --> 17:47.867
<i>Come to the faculty office, now.</i>

17:47.947 --> 17:49.827
What'd you get into this time?

17:49.907 --> 17:51.367
[TEACHER] <i>Ageha Yoshina!</i>

17:51.457 --> 17:53.497
<i>You better be</i>
<i>on your way, or so help me!</i>

17:53.577 --> 17:54.577
Oh, he's mad!

17:54.667 --> 17:56.287
Do you think this is
about the time I used

17:56.377 --> 17:58.297
the principal's car
to grill some meat?

17:58.377 --> 17:59.837
Dude, what is your life?

17:59.917 --> 18:01.087
-[BOY] Ageha!
-[BOTH] Hmm?

18:01.167 --> 18:03.337
I would steer clear
of the office.

18:03.427 --> 18:04.387
[AGEHA] Why?

18:04.467 --> 18:06.547
Some fake cops
wanna talk to you.

18:07.177 --> 18:08.387
I know police badges,

18:08.467 --> 18:11.097
and the ones they flashed
were totally bogus.

18:11.177 --> 18:13.557
The cop's kid
saves the day, again!

18:13.637 --> 18:14.727
Well, see ya!

18:14.807 --> 18:16.307
I was never here!

18:16.397 --> 18:17.477
Yeah, I know.

18:18.147 --> 18:19.817
[AGEHA] <i>The guy</i>
<i>from the occult club was right.</i>

18:20.397 --> 18:23.027
<i>Investigating Psyren</i>
<i>is hazardous to your health.</i>

18:23.107 --> 18:24.067
<i>Still though,</i>

18:24.147 --> 18:25.367
<i>why come after me?</i>

18:28.537 --> 18:29.787
What?

18:29.867 --> 18:33.117
Are you going somewhere,
Ageha Yoshina?

18:33.787 --> 18:34.827
What's it to ya?

18:34.917 --> 18:36.167
I know you're a faker.

18:36.247 --> 18:39.457
Well then, that just
makes our job a bit easier.

18:39.547 --> 18:42.877
Now, allow us to proceed civilly
and you'll be fine.

18:42.967 --> 18:45.007
Hand over the Psyren card.

18:45.087 --> 18:46.797
Yeah, sorry. You lost me there.

18:46.887 --> 18:48.507
You can't fool us.

18:48.597 --> 18:50.387
There's not a payphone
in the country

18:50.467 --> 18:52.267
that we don't have our eyes on.

18:52.347 --> 18:53.347
[scoffs]

18:53.427 --> 18:56.267
You geezers are that desperate
for the prize money, huh?

18:56.347 --> 18:58.107
My dear boy.

18:58.187 --> 19:01.727
[scoffs] You have no idea
what that phone card is worth.

19:01.817 --> 19:03.277
-[yells]
-[gasps]

19:03.357 --> 19:04.697
[both grunt]

19:06.947 --> 19:08.867
[screams]

19:08.987 --> 19:13.697
[MAN] And you have no clue
about Psyren, what it truly is.

19:13.787 --> 19:15.907
It is a world unto itself.

19:15.997 --> 19:18.037
The great will of all things.

19:18.127 --> 19:19.997
[AGEHA] <i>Well,</i>
<i>this guy's freaking nuts.</i>

19:20.087 --> 19:21.457
Search him.

19:21.547 --> 19:23.757
We need that card
before it awakens.

19:23.837 --> 19:25.507
[grunts]

19:25.587 --> 19:27.177
-Miyake!
-[groans]

19:27.257 --> 19:28.847
[yelps]

19:28.927 --> 19:29.847
[grunts]

19:29.927 --> 19:31.347
[groans, coughs]

19:31.427 --> 19:33.887
-[choking]
-That brat! After him!

19:33.967 --> 19:36.307
[Ageha panting]

19:37.637 --> 19:40.607
-Damn it! My eyes!
-[MAN] Find him, now!

19:40.727 --> 19:42.397
We're almost out of time!

19:42.477 --> 19:44.187
[ringing]

19:44.277 --> 19:45.567
[AGEHA] <i>Is that a phone?</i>

19:45.647 --> 19:46.897
<i>Where's it coming from?</i>

19:46.987 --> 19:48.197
<i>It's not mine.</i>

19:48.277 --> 19:49.777
<i>Right, my phone!</i>

19:49.867 --> 19:50.777
<i>I can call for help!</i>

19:51.697 --> 19:53.327
Hiro! Saka!

19:53.407 --> 19:54.867
Damn it, I can't see!

19:54.947 --> 19:56.707
[ringing]

19:56.787 --> 19:59.167
Yeah, I know!
Stop ringing, damn it!

20:00.167 --> 20:01.287
[MIYAKE] We've got him!

20:01.797 --> 20:02.877
[laughs]

20:03.457 --> 20:05.127
Someone! Please!

20:05.257 --> 20:06.547
Pick up the phone!

20:07.837 --> 20:08.797
[gasps]

20:12.307 --> 20:13.847
[warbled speaking]

20:18.387 --> 20:20.307
[wind howling]

20:20.397 --> 20:21.687
Uh?

20:22.267 --> 20:25.067
Huh? What the... How...

20:25.147 --> 20:26.607
What is this?

20:27.107 --> 20:28.857
Am I dreaming?

20:28.947 --> 20:30.407
-[man screams]
-Is someone there?

20:30.487 --> 20:31.567
[whimpers]

20:31.657 --> 20:33.077
Somebody help me! I beg you!

20:33.157 --> 20:34.287
I'm coming!

20:34.867 --> 20:36.367
-[creature screeches]
-[gasps]

20:36.947 --> 20:39.157
-[gasps]
-[grunts]

20:39.247 --> 20:40.917
-What?
-[man groaning]

20:41.417 --> 20:42.537
[groans]

20:44.747 --> 20:45.997
Did it kill him?

20:47.967 --> 20:49.467
[screams]

20:49.547 --> 20:51.297
[AMAMIYA] Yoshina! Get down!

20:51.387 --> 20:52.637
[slashes]

20:52.717 --> 20:54.097
[gasps]

20:54.177 --> 20:55.517
Huh?

20:58.727 --> 20:59.977
Whoa, Amamiya!

21:00.057 --> 21:01.187
I can't believe...

21:01.267 --> 21:03.227
Just what the hell
are you doing here?

21:03.307 --> 21:05.227
I am not sure.

21:05.317 --> 21:07.897
-It all happened so quickly.
-Don't joke!

21:07.987 --> 21:09.737
You called Psyren, right?

21:09.817 --> 21:12.067
And then you used the card!
I know you did!

21:12.157 --> 21:14.657
You mean toss five mil?
Then, yes!

21:14.737 --> 21:17.237
You idiot! You have no idea
what you've done,

21:17.327 --> 21:19.407
or the danger
you've gotten yourself into!

21:19.497 --> 21:20.457
Why'd you do it?

21:20.537 --> 21:23.167
Because you asked me
to save you, dummy.

21:23.247 --> 21:25.837
-[gasps]
-[coughs] I heard you.

21:26.417 --> 21:29.167
<i>Although I'm starting to think</i>
<i>you didn't want me to.</i>

21:29.917 --> 21:32.797
[crying]

21:38.927 --> 21:41.017
Why'd you have to be so stupid?

21:41.597 --> 21:44.767
[AGEHA] <i>Back then, I thought</i>
<i>I was the one making the call.</i>

21:45.267 --> 21:46.817
<i>Turns out I answered one</i>

21:46.897 --> 21:49.437
<i>from the mysterious Nemesis Q.</i>

21:50.487 --> 21:53.157
<i>That's how this game of life</i>
<i>and death started for me.</i>

21:55.277 --> 21:56.487
<i>Psyren.</i>

21:56.617 --> 21:58.447
<i>A world unto itself.</i>

21:59.617 --> 22:01.037
[OPERATOR]
<i>Worlds will be connected</i>

22:01.117 --> 22:03.457
<i>in three, two, one.</i>

22:05.167 --> 22:07.167
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:35.047 --> 23:37.177
[payphone ringing]

23:37.257 --> 23:39.967
EPISODE 2
TAVOO
